efinitions%20and%20checked%20obligations%20under%20their%20explicit%20foundations.%20Equal%20names%2C%20source%20text%2C%20labels%20or%20declared%20meaning%20signatures%20alone%20cannot%20certify%20semantic%20equivalence%3B%20unresolved%20obligations%20preserve%20separate%20concepts.%0A-%20%60I195-INTERCHANGE-REVERSE-CONVERSION%60%3A%20For%20every%20format%2C%20source%20grammar%20-%3E%20native%20links%20-%3E%20exported%20grammar%20-%3E%20native%20links%20is%20structurally%20and%20semantically%20equivalent%20with%20the%20original%20source%20unavailable%20to%20the%20emitter%2C%20and%20the%20lossless%20mode%20reconstructs%20the%20source%20exactly.%0A-%20%60I195-MERGE-MEANING-AWARE-DEDUPLICATION%60%3A%20Duplicates%20are%20recognized%20by%20meaning-aware%20normalization%2C%20recursive%20graph%20and%20alpha-equivalence%2C%20lexical%20and%20parser%20semantics%20and%20justified%20mappings.%20Name%20similarity%20and%20generated%20samples%20only%20nominate%20candidates%2C%20differently%20named%20equivalent%20concepts%20are%20merged%2C%20and%20identically%20named%20non-equivalent%20concepts%20are%20not.%0A-%20%60I195-SELF-TRANSLATION-ROUND-TRIP%60%3A%20JavaScript%20%E2%86%92%20links%20%E2%86%92%20JavaScript%20and%20Rust%20%E2%86%92%20links%20%E2%86%92%20Rust%20are%20byte-identical%20on%20meta-language%27s%20own%20sources%2C%20and%20JavaScript%20%E2%86%92%20Rust%20%E2%86%92%20JavaScript%20and%20Rust%20%E2%86%92%20JavaScript%20%E2%86%92%20Rust%20preserve%20behavior%2C%20keeping%20comments%2C%20layout%20and%20names%20through%20provenance%20where%20the%20target%20can%20express%20them.%0A-%20%60I195-SEMANTICS-FAITHFUL-BEHAVIOR%60%3A%20All%2012%20directed%20translations%20preserve%20errors%2C%20aborts%2C%20overflow%20and%20effects%2C%20using%20a%20faithful%20operational%20encoding%20and%20runtime%20where%20the%20target%20has%20no%20native%20concept.%20An%20unsupported-construct%20diagnostic%2C%20source%20pass-through%20or%20a%20non-aborting-only%20claim%20does%20not%20count.%0A-%20%